================================================================================
## Replace the SWRL execution engine with SHACL-AF rules (engine swap)
================================================================================

Context: SWRL inference was executed by the bespoke SWRL engine translating
IF/THEN rules to SQL on the flat triple store. We swap the execution engine to
canonical SHACL-AF rules (sh:TripleRule / sh:SPARQLRule) while keeping the
authoring UI, the stored model, and every capability identical, and keeping
SQL-at-scale execution on Delta/Lakebase. Rules authored in the UI are still
SWRL; they are transpiled to SHACL-AF at execution time. Provenance
(`swrl:<rule>`) and result stats (`phase = "swrl"`) are preserved so the UI,
MCP, and Data-Quality pipeline see no change.

Changes:

1. src/back/core/reasoning/shacl_rules/ShaclRule.py
   New canonical SHACL-AF rule model (rule_type, target_class_uri,
   construct_sparql, canonical Turtle, preserved executable body).
2. src/back/core/reasoning/shacl_rules/SwrlToShaclTranspiler.py
   New transpiler SWRL dict -> ShaclRule. Simple assertions -> sh:TripleRule;
   built-ins/negation/multi-hop -> sh:SPARQLRule with a CONSTRUCT body. Reuses
   SWRLEngine._build_uri_map() for identical URI resolution; renders canonical
   SHACL Turtle.
3. src/back/core/reasoning/shacl_rules/ShaclRuleSqlTranslator.py
   New SHACL-rule -> SQL path. Delegates to the flat-triple SQL backend
   (SWRLSQLTranslator) to guarantee byte-for-byte parity for built-ins,
   closed-world negation, multi-hop joins, focus, limit, and materialisation.
4. src/back/core/reasoning/shacl_rules/ShaclRuleEngine.py
   New engine; drop-in replacement for SWRLEngine (same signature/result).
   Emits InferredTriple provenance `swrl:<rule>` and stats `phase = "swrl"`
   (plus `engine = "shacl-af"`).
5. src/back/core/reasoning/shacl_rules/__init__.py
   Package exports.
6. src/back/core/reasoning/ReasoningService.py
   run_swrl_rules() now uses ShaclRuleEngine (simulation inherits it). Phase
   docstring updated.
7. src/back/objects/digitaltwin/quality/SqlQualityChecks.py
   _eval_swrl_rule() + _swrl_antecedent_population_sql() routed through the
   SHACL translator (ShaclRule + context) for SWRL violation detection.
8. tests/units/reasoning/test_shacl_rule_engine.py
   New golden parity suite: identical SQL vs SWRLEngine across unary/binary
   atoms, comparison + string built-ins, negation, property chains,
   materialisation, focus, inference_limit; provenance/stats contract;
   transpiler rule-type + Turtle.
9. tests/units/dtwin/test_v090_dq_sql_checks.py
   Updated the two direct _swrl_antecedent_population_sql unit tests to the new
   (table, rule, ctx) translator contract.
10. docs/superpowers/specs/2026-11-07-swrl-to-shacl-rules-study.md
    Design/feasibility study documenting the architecture, parity strategy,
    preserved contract, capability map, and follow-ups.

